      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Kyzyl-Tas open-pit copper mine** - history of the twins in InfluxDB. Solid lines: the live mine (with any active what-if scenario). Dashed grey: the shadow baseline that never receives scenarios. Mine time runs 60× real time (1 minute = 1 mine hour). Live 3D view: [http://localhost:8000](http://localhost:8000)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "SAG mill feed",
      "datasource": {
